      "summary": ": Saturday/Rāhoroi - Meri Kirihimete It’s a magical winterland at Treble Cone as we celebrate Mid Winter Christmas! We’ve welcomed another 12cm of fresh snow overnight top of the Home Basin, snow conditions are glorious and it is going to be a ripper of a day. Patrol will be checking out conditions in The Saddle therefore could be a delay, will keep you updated. Warm up with a delicious Christmas lunch at the TC Café. There’s nothing better than fresh snow, great turns, and a festive feast. It is a chilly one today, expected to clear to a fine day. Layer up, you will want an extra layer under that Christmas jumper. Road is chains on 2WD from chain bay 2.",
